    "created_at": "2025-03-19T12:18:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-19T12:18:23Z",
    "body": "Since port was mentioned, Is it intended that basic URL parsing `invalid80` with state override set to `Port` will fail? See: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/58257b113ea697d981808fed11daeaea30ab6bd1/urlpattern/resources/urlpatterntestdata.json#L1234\r\n\r\nI guess the pattern spec was written with the intent of failure being returned here, but without URL spec doing it?\r\n\r\nCurrently spec will return a null port, the WPT test above seems to expect no match to happen by error being thrown during canonicalization.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
